# Agent efficiency

- User-facing replies: RTL Persian in `<div dir="rtl" lang="fa">`. Isolate paths and English identifiers.
- Explore with `graphify` before Grep/Read/Glob. Spawn at most two subagents, only for independent parallel work. Prefer `.cursor/agents/graphify-explore.md`.
- Never print tokens, webhook secrets, subscription URLs, UUIDs, raw `.env` values, or receipt file IDs.
- After material code/schema/behavior changes, update `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`, stamp, then `pnpm check`.
- Do not commit, push, deploy, or enable pilot provisioning unless the owner explicitly asked.
